# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2026-09-11: this repository is PUBLIC and its purpose is the CV — README.md
# and README-php.md — and nothing else. Everything below is either personal
# data, other people's personal data, or working tooling that has no business
# on a public profile. Default to ignoring; add deliberately, never by `git add -A`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Job-search archive: every posting evaluated, plus recruiter names, emails and
# phone numbers transcribed from WhatsApp referral groups. Other people's
# contact details — the single most important thing here NOT to publish.
jobs/
documents/

# The application CRM, including MySQL dumps of every company applied to,
# interview notes and correspondence links.
job-tracker/

# The pipeline itself: crawlers, screens, the WhatsApp CDP reader, agents and
# skills. Also all Python, which neither CV claims.
